      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-01-27T14:23:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ra-Tempest makes it rain fire.</p><p>Tachyon-Expatriette can shoot at someone, then outrun the bullet in order to punch the target in the face a few times before it gets there.</p><p>Unity-Captain Cosmic ends up populating half the world in robotic energy constructs (a small army of which resembles a predatory dinosaur).</p><p>Unity-Fanatic flies around dropping Raptor Bots on people's heads.</p><p>Ab'Zero-Visionary goes around giving people a literal brain freeze.</p><p>Bunker-Naturalist can shapeshift to give himself any number of teeth, claws, guns, or armour plating.</p><p>I'm sure I'll think of some more at some point ;).</p>",
