      "created_at": "2016-02-29T19:35:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I kinda get the feeling that \"fun to say\" is high among Devrah's priorities.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Really, her three non-Freedom-Five forms map pretty well to Naturalist's.&nbsp; Chomps is damage like Crocodile, Bee is utility/disruption like gazelle, and Platform is tanking (sorta) like Rhino.&nbsp; Mrs. Chomps, UniBee, and... Platformity?&nbsp; Not sure on the name for that last one.</p>",
